      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Create an iterator instead of normal loop iteration for a\nmore flexible and extensible iteration. \n\nFor ex: Implementing shuffled iteration, reverse iteration\nwithout modifying existing core code.",
      "fontSize": 7.685702313322019,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Create an iterator instead of normal loop iteration for a more flexible and extensible iteration. \n\nFor ex: Implementing shuffled iteration, reverse iteration without modifying existing core code.",
