      "text": "Structural Design Pattern",
      "fontSize": 17.292830204974546,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Structural Design Pattern",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zX691o18hEsgOGWnF3ajc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -928.6724566113637,
      "y": 1267.693768335036,
      "width": 261.9322340827377,
      "height": 28.82138367495758,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1920993176,
      "version": 419,
      "versionNonce": 1987776800,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "These patterns focus on organizing and connecting components (or\nobjects) within a system in an efficient, reusable, and maintainable\nway.",
      "fontSize": 7.685702313322019,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "These patterns focus on organizing and connecting components (or objects) within a system in an efficient, reusable, and maintainable way.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UTBzQdecRUQYdB8KLuGbN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -930.7268348764912,
      "y": 1308.91260858526,
      "width": 249.41959319476544,
      "height": 19.21425578330505,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2087568360,
      "version": 291,
      "versionNonce": 257036512,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "They don’t just create objects; they explain how to assemble\nobjects and classes into larger structures",
      "fontSize": 7.685702313322019,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "They don’t just create objects; they explain how to assemble objects and classes into larger structures",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UJa4OGF-eA8M-_J8Juykw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2043.4287618260619,
      "y": 1476.9483554737885,
      "width": 52.40109515187648,
      "height": 16.812473810391918,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1091116729,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 1396436256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adapter",
      "fontSize": 13.449979048313534,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Adapter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xTPyyX5h__ZgyOmCu1odH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2122.743597075502,
      "y": 1502.3141212038354,
      "width": 216.83621838055123,
      "height": 38.4285115666101,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 698398457,
      "version": 553,
      "versionNonce": 10286304,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We can have an adapter class that can act as a\nmiddleman connecting different types of classes, in order\nto achieve more consistency across various similar\nclasses.",
      "fontSize": 7.685702313322021,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We can have an adapter class that can act as a middleman connecting different types of classes, in order to achieve more consistency across various similar classes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nHZZgAcNY5nzMo5E2ytYZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2435.5289855582723,
      "y": 1575.994720599998,
      "width": 281.6965107781009,
      "height": 86.46415102487272,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bhJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1190147031,
      "version": 405,
      "versionNonce": 461457696,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "String deviceType = \"SmartLight\"; // Imagine this value is dynamic\n    if (deviceType.equals(\"AirConditioner\")) {\n      AirConditioner airConditioner = new AirConditioner();\n      airConditioner.connectViaBluetooth();\n      airConditioner.startCooling();\n    } else if (deviceType.equals(\"SmartLight\")) {\n      SmartLight smartLight = new SmartLight();\n      smartLight.connectToWiFi();\n      smartLight.switchOn();",
      "fontSize": 7.68570231332202,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "String deviceType = \"SmartLight\"; // Imagine this value is dynamic\n    if (deviceType.equals(\"AirConditioner\")) {\n      AirConditioner airConditioner = new AirConditioner();\n      airConditioner.connectViaBluetooth();\n      airConditioner.startCooling();\n    } else if (deviceType.equals(\"SmartLight\")) {\n      SmartLight smartLight = new SmartLight();\n      smartLight.connectToWiFi();\n      smartLight.switchOn();",
