    {
      "id": "yxnXBUsblr4cSGxohSYWu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -818.7279501929852,
      "y": 1536.1033203960433,
      "width": 136.80966757034093,
      "height": 144.10691837478788,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bi3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2103838583,
      "version": 488,
      "versionNonce": 2060881184,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272909494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. What happens when you add a\nnew type of component?\n\nFor example, a new Garage or\nGarden that also contains devices.\n\n‍\n\n2. What if the hierarchy changes?\n\nFor instance, a new concept like a\nZone is introduced, which groups\nrooms.\n\n‍",
      "fontSize": 7.685702313322021,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. What happens when you add a new type of component?\n\nFor example, a new Garage or Garden that also contains devices.\n\n‍\n\n2. What if the hierarchy changes?\n\nFor instance, a new concept like a Zone is introduced, which groups rooms.\n\n‍",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
