      "originalText": "public class AirConditioner implements SmartComponent {\n  @Override\n  public void turnOn() {\n    System.out.println(\"Air Conditioner is now ON.\");\n  }\n  @Override\n  public void turnOff() {\n    System.out.println(\"Air Conditioner is now OFF.\");\n  }\n}",
